      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This looks so ass on 4K - main content is not centered, there's giant amount of space and still the collapsible friend list is covering the content and adds extra clicks to toggle it. There's enough space from FHD and above to keep the friend list on the right static and move the content to the center. We don't need mobile style navigation on desktop. AAAAAAAAAAA.",
